sequenceDiagram
    participant Dev as Developer
    participant AppAcc as Member Account (App)
    participant SCP as Service Control Policy
    participant Service as AWS Service (DynamoDB)
    participant CloudTrail as Organization CloudTrail
    participant LogAcc as Log Archive Account
    
    Dev->>AppAcc: API Call (Create Table)
    AppAcc->>SCP: Evaluate Policy
    SCP-->>AppAcc: Allow (No explicit deny)
    AppAcc->>Service: Execute Action
    Service-->>AppAcc: Success
    Service->>CloudTrail: Log Event
    CloudTrail->>LogAcc: Store securely in Central S3
